                                "sense_id": "e832dae0-631a-3867-9fd7-5a4ef67ed6bd",
                                "text": "It was the exhilaration of moments like this that made the audience somewhat restless during the band's long warm-up sets later in the evening, sets primarily made up of craftsmanly but unimaginative reworkings of contemporary pop-funk."
                            }
                        ]
